<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Support & Help Center - LaborRegister</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #1B55C0;
            --primary-hover: #15459e;
            --text-dark: #1E293B;
            --text-muted: #64748B;
            --bg-light: #F8FAFC;
            --card-bg: #FFFFFF;
            --border: #E2E8F0;
            --success: #16A34A;
        }

        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            :root {
                --primary: #3B82F6;
                --primary-hover: #60A5FA;
                --text-dark: #F1F5F9;
                --text-muted: #94A3B8;
                --bg-light: #0F172A;
                --card-bg: #1E293B;
                --border: #334155;
                --success: #22C55E;
            }
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-light);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 24px 16px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 760px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 36px;
        }

        .app-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(27, 85, 192, 0.1);
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        h1 {
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-size: 30px;
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .sub-header {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 15px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .card-contact {
            background: rgba(27, 85, 192, 0.04);
            border: 1.5px dashed var(--primary);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 28px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 36px;
        }

        .card-contact h2 {
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            font-size: 20px;
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        .card-contact p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 0 0 20px 0;
        }

        .email-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: var(--primary);
            color: #ffffff !important;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 15px;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background 0.2s ease;
        }

        .email-btn:hover {
            background: var(--primary-hover);
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 19px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 32px 0 16px 0;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .faq-item {
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            background: var(--card-bg);
        }

        .faq-question {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            margin: 0 0 6px 0;
        }

        .faq-answer {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .features-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .container {
                padding: 24px 18px;
            }
        }

        .feature-box {
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 14px 16px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: var(--bg-light);
        }

        .feature-box strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .feature-box span {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 36px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <div class="app-badge">LaborRegister App</div>
        <h1>Customer Support & Help Center</h1>
        <p class="sub-header">Need assistance, have feedback, or want to report an issue? We're here to help.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Contact Box -->
    <div class="card-contact">
        <h2>Direct Support</h2>
        <p>Our dedicated support team typically responds within 24 hours.</p>
        <a href="mailto:surajbbu2029@gmail.com" class="email-btn">Email: surajbbu2029@gmail.com</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Overview Grid -->
    <div class="section-title">App Highlights</div>
    <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-box">
            <strong>100% Offline App</strong>
            <span>All records stay private on your device</span>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-box">
            <strong>Instant PDF Reports</strong>
            <span>Generate attendance statements in 1-tap</span>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-box">
            <strong>Hourly Overtime Engine</strong>
            <span>Accurate overtime and wage calculation</span>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-box">
            <strong>Integrated Cash Register</strong>
            <span>Track business Cash In and Cash Out</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQs -->
    <div class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <p class="faq-question">1. How do I backup my attendance and payroll data?</p>
        <p class="faq-answer">Open <strong>Settings</strong> > tap <strong>App Backup</strong> > click <strong>Export / Backup Data</strong>. You can safely save this JSON backup file to your iCloud Drive, Google Drive, or local storage.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <p class="faq-question">2. How can I transfer my records to a new iPhone?</p>
        <p class="faq-answer">Export a backup file on your old phone and save it to your iCloud. On your new device, open LaborRegister, go to <strong>Settings</strong> > <strong>App Backup</strong> > <strong>Import / Restore Data</strong>, and select the backup file.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <p class="faq-question">3. How is monthly salary calculated for different month lengths?</p>
        <p class="faq-answer">The app automatically divides the monthly wage by the exact number of days in that specific month (28, 29, 30, or 31 days) to determine the accurate daily wage rate.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <p class="faq-question">4. Can I change the default currency symbol?</p>
        <p class="faq-answer">Yes. Navigate to <strong>Settings</strong> > <strong>Change Currency</strong> and select your preferred currency (₹, $, €, £, AED, SAR, and more).</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        &copy; 2026 LaborRegister. All rights reserved. Built for business owners & contractors.
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
